items.source:
Parses the query for <a href="../../expression/ValueExpression.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.expression"><code>value expressions</code></a> using the
pattern:

<pre>&lt;prefix&gt;#{&lt;spel&gt;}
&lt;prefix&gt;${&lt;property placeholder&gt;}
</pre>

items.translation:
使用以下模式解析查询以查找<a href="../../expression/ValueExpression.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.expression"><code>值表达式</code></a>：

<pre>&lt;前缀&gt;#{&lt;spel&gt;}
&lt;前缀&gt;${&lt;属性占位符&gt;}
</pre>
